WEBVTT

00:11:57.379 --> 00:12:01.008
Making sure that I'm having enough fun
has made me a better partner,

00:12:01.049 --> 00:12:03.427
a better parent and a better friend.

00:12:04.344 --> 00:12:06.388
And it has convinced me of something

00:12:06.430 --> 00:12:09.767
that I very much hope
I can convince you of as well,

00:12:09.808 --> 00:12:12.019
which is that my daughter was right.

00:12:12.644 --> 00:12:14.646
Fun is sunshine.

00:12:15.272 --> 00:12:17.733
It's a distillation of life's energy.

00:12:18.066 --> 00:12:20.611
And the more often we experience it,

00:12:20.611 --> 00:12:23.614
the more we will feel
like we're actually alive.

00:12:24.072 --> 00:12:25.199
Thank you.

00:12:25.240 --> 00:12:30.287
(Cheers and applause)